cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  Artifact for "A Fitted Detector Error Model Fails Two Qualification Tests on
  a Heron Processor"
message: If you use this artifact, please cite the paper.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Jiachen
    family-names: Shen
    email: jshen28@cougarnet.uh.edu
    affiliation: University of Houston
    orcid: https://orcid.org/0000-0002-7233-497X
