license: MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/Mercury0828/mixdec-artifact
abstract: >-
  Cached hardware records, the submitted instruction-set circuit, the frozen
  analysis and the generated claim list behind two qualification tests for a
  fitted detector error model, measured on a 156-qubit IBM Heron r2 processor
  running a distance-9 repetition memory. One driver regenerates every reported
  number from the caches; no step spends processor time.
keywords:
  - quantum error correction
  - detector error model
  - windowed decoding
  - model qualification
  - repetition code
